<section class="sec" id="how" aria-labelledby="how-h">
<div class="container">
<div class="sec-head">
<h2 id="how-h">Three things that shape everything I do.</h2>
</div>
<div class="principles">
<div class="principle">
<h3>Behavior is communication.</h3>
<p>What's often called behavior is a response — to something in the environment, or something internal. My focus is understanding what set it off and what need it was trying to meet.</p>
</div>
<div class="principle">
<h3>Play is the work.</h3>
<p>Therapy centers on the activity your child actually wants support with, done in real time so we can see what's helping and what isn't. For young children, that looks a lot like play.</p>
</div>
<div class="principle">
<h3>We're partners.</h3>
<p>This is relationship-based. I work in partnership with your child and your family, and welcome everyone in as it fits. Feedback is always welcome.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sec-foot"><a class="lnk" href="/about/#approach">More about how I work →</a></div>
</div>
</section>

