<section class="sec" id="fit" aria-labelledby="fit-h">
<div class="container">
<div class="sec-head">
<h2 id="fit-h">Is this a fit for your family?</h2>
<p>The honest version, so you can work it out before you spend anything.</p>
</div>
<div class="fit">
<div class="fit-col fit-yes">
<h3>This is probably a fit if</h3>
<ul>
<li>Your child is between {{ site.ages.from }} and {{ site.ages.to }} — I'm most specialized in {{ site.ages.specialty }}, and I'll sometimes take an older child up to 18, so ask</li>
<li>You're in {{ site.baseTown }} or {{ site.region }} — or further out on the Olympic Peninsula and open to remote sessions</li>
<li>Something in daily life has become hard, with or without a diagnosis</li>
<li>You want to be part of sessions rather than wait in a lobby</li>
<li>You're waiting on an assessment, a diagnosis, or an early-intervention place and don't want to lose that time</li>
<li>You can work with private pay, or want to talk through whether it's viable</li>
</ul>
</div>
<div class="fit-col fit-no">
<h3>You may be better served elsewhere if</h3>
<ul>
<li>You need therapy billed directly to insurance — a clinic that takes your plan will cost you less</li>
<li>Your child needs specialized clinic equipment as the core of their therapy</li>
<li>You're looking for speech or physical therapy — those are different professions, and I'm glad to point you toward local options</li>
<li>You need a formal diagnostic evaluation; that's a different process, usually through your pediatrician</li>
</ul>
<p class="fit-note">If any of these are you, say so when you get in touch. I'd rather send you to the right place than take you on.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

